flowchart LR
  SDK[Existing JS SDK] --> Edge[CloudFront + ALB ingest API]
  Edge --> Auth[Tenant auth, schema normalize, idempotency key]
  Auth --> KDS[Kinesis Data Streams provisioned]
  KDS --> Raw[Firehose to S3 raw events by tenant_bucket/date/hour]
  KDS --> Realtime[ECS KCL 3.x enhanced fan-out consumers]
  Realtime --> Redis[ElastiCache Redis hot user state + segment counters]
  Realtime --> Metrics[Aggregated dashboard store]
  Realtime --> DLQ[SQS DLQ for poison events]
  Redis --> Rules[Personalization rule evaluator]
  Metrics --> API[Dashboard API]
  Raw --> Athena[Athena/Glue historical analysis]
  Raw --> Export[Customer exports to Snowflake/BigQuery]
  Postgres[(PostgreSQL metadata)]
  Postgres --> Auth
  Postgres --> Rules
